percent_shares({"web": 1, "api": 1, "db": 1}) == {"web": 33, "api": 34, "db": 33}

`test_regression_issue_455` expects:
percent_shares({"web": 1, "api": 1, "db": 1}) == {"web": 34, "api": 33, "db": 33}

These are mutually exclusive. Please clarify the intended tie-breaking behavior.

